<title>USA: Intl Knife &amp; Saw issues $90 mln 144a 10-year debt. [CORRECTED 15:02 GMT]</title>
<headline>Intl Knife &amp; Saw issues $90 mln 144a 10-year debt. [CORRECTED 15:02 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement debt issue from International Knife &amp; Saw was priced late on Thursday, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>The deal was increased in size by $5 million.</p>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co Inc is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER INTERNATIONAL KNIFE &amp; SAW</p>
<p>AMT $90 MLN	  COUPON 11.375 PCT MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 5/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 11.375 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS			   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 33-1/3 AT 111.375</p>
<p>(Corrects last S&amp;P from &quot;single-B&quot;).</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
